rect":false,"reference":"21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"loved","correct":false,"reference":"visited"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"sad","correct":false,"reference":"angry"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"protect","correct":false,"reference":"take care of"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"30"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"happy"}],"comment":"你整体完成得很不错，大部分题目都答对了，继续加油哦！现在来看几处小错误：第2空：你写了travelling，正确答案是nature，注意区分nature（自然）和travelling（旅行），题目说他从小对自然感兴趣，应填nature；第5空：你写了22，正确是21，徐霞客21岁开始旅行，别记错啦；第6空：你写了loved，正确是visited，此处指游览山水，用visited更合适；第7空：你写了sad，正确是angry，有人破坏自然时他会生气而非难过；第8空：你写了protect，正确是take care of，固定搭配呼吁人们照料自然，用take care of更准确。答对的1、3、4、9、10空都很棒，多熟悉小知识点就更完美啦！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791989854738_8084.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 22:57:36"}},{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"travellers"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"travelling","correct":false,"reference":"nature"},{"num":3,"studentAnswer":"mountains and rivers","correct":true,"reference":"mountains and rivers"},{"num":4,"studentAnswer":"see","correct":true,"reference":"see"},{"num":5,"studentAnswer":"22","correct":false,"reference":"21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"loved","correct":false,"reference":"visited"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"sad","correct":false,"reference":"angry"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"protect","correct":false,"reference":"take care of"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"30"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"happy"}],"comment":"你有4道题回答正确，分别是第1、3、4、9题；第2题应填nature，第5题正确数字是21，第6题应填visited，第7题应填angry，第8题应填take care of，建议结合文本内容核对对应知识点哦。","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791989489674_7535.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 22:51:31"}}]},"2":{"members":[]},"23":{"members":[{},{"opinion":{"content":"I think Xu Xiake is a great traveller. I like him because he loved nature and travelled a lot. I can learn to protect nature like him.","comment":"你写的内容清晰表达了对徐霞客的看法，真棒！整体无语法错误，用词合适～ 第三句可以稍调整，比如改成“I can learn to protect nature from him”，让句子更通顺完整，继续加油呀！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791990225805_3295.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:03:47"}},{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"one of the most famous travellers in China"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"travelling","correct":false,"reference":"He was interested in nature from a young age"},{"num":3,"studentAnswer":"mountains and rivers","correct":true,"reference":"He read books about famous mountains and rivers"},{"num":4,"studentAnswer":"see","correct":true,"reference":"He wanted to see them with his eyes"},{"num":5,"studentAnswer":"22","correct":false,"reference":"He started to travel at the age of 21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"loved","correct":false,"reference":"He visited mountains and rivers"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"sad","correct":false,"reference":"He was angry and always called for people to take care of nature"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"protect","correct":false,"reference":"called for people to take care of nature"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"He travelled for about 30 years"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"He was happy with his life of travel"}],"comment":"这次徐霞客主题作业，你有不少答对的空值得肯定，第1、3、4、9、10空都和正确答案一致，很棒哦！咱们来看看答错的地方：第2空你写了travelling，正确答案是nature，注意区分“nature（自然）”和“travelling（旅行）”；第5空你写了22，正确是21，别记错徐霞客开始游历的年龄啦；第6空你写了loved，正确是visited，理清“热爱”和“游历”的词义；第7空你写了sad，正确是angry；第8空你写了protect，正确是take care of，注意短语的区别。继续加油，下次答题肯定能更准！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791990245943_7193.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:04:07"}},{},{},{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"travellers"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"travelling","correct"